Package: synos-wallpapers
Version: ${VERSION}
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: synos-dconf-runtime, ${BRAND_ID}-branding
Provides: ubuntu-wallpapers
Maintainer: ${BRAND_VENDOR} <${BRAND_URL_SUPPORT}>
Description: ${BRAND_NAME} default wallpaper selection
 Points the desktop and lock screen defaults at the wallpaper shipped by the
 ${BRAND_NAME} brand kit and lists it in the background chooser. Replaces the
 upstream wallpaper collection; the artwork itself comes from branding/.
